<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>QC Report — {{ cohort_name }}</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #fdfdfb;
    --fg: #1a1a1a;
    --muted: #6b7280;
    --border: #e2ddd6;
    --accent: #2c3e50;
    --accent-light: #e8edf2;
    --table-stripe: #f7f5f1;
    --ok: #27ae60;
    --warn: #e67e22;
    --fail: #c0392b;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: Georgia, "Iowan Old Style", "Palatino Linotype", serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2em 2.5em;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 1.7em;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent);
    padding-bottom: 0.35em;
    margin-bottom: 0.3em;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.2em;
    margin-top: 2.8em;
    padding: 0.45em 0.9em;
    background: var(--accent-light);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 1em;
    margin-top: 1.8em;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .meta {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.88em;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    margin-bottom: 1.2em;
  }
  .tip {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.82em;
    color: var(--muted);
    background: var(--table-stripe);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.5em 0.9em;
    margin-bottom: 1.8em;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  
  .status { font-weight: bold; text-align: center; font-size: 1.1em; }
  .status-ok   { color: var(--ok); }
  .status-warn { color: var(--warn); }
  .status-fail { color: var(--fail); }
  .flags { font-size: 0.85em; color: var(--warn); text-align: left; max-width: 280px; }
  .flags-fail { color: var(--fail); }

  
  .legend {
    background: var(--table-stripe);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.8em 1.2em;
    margin: 1em 0 1.8em;
    font-size: 0.85em;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  }

  
  table {
    border-collapse: collapse;
    width: 100%;
    font-family: "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.84em;
    margin: 1em 0;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 7px 10px;
    text-align: right;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  th {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.92em;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  th:first-child, td:first-child { text-align: left; }
  tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: var(--table-stripe); }
  tbody tr:hover { background: var(--accent-light); }

  
  img {
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  
  .plot-grid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.8em; margin: 1.2em 0; }
  .plot-row {
    border-left: 4px solid var(--border);
    padding-left: 1.2em;
    padding-bottom: 0.5em;
  }
  .plot-row.warn { border-left-color: var(--warn); }
  .plot-row.fail { border-left-color: var(--fail); }
  .plot-row-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin-bottom: 0.4em;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5em;
  }
  .plot-row-header .sid { font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.05em; }
  .plot-row-header .summary {
    color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.84em;
    font-family: "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  }
  .plot-row-flags { font-size: 0.84em; color: var(--warn); margin-bottom: 0.5em; }
  .plot-row-flags.fail { color: var(--fail); }

  
  footer {
    margin-top: 4em;
    padding-top: 1.2em;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.84em;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  }
  .footer-meta {
    margin-bottom: 1.2em;
    font-size: 0.92em;
  }
  .ai-note {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.88em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5em;
  }
  details { margin-top: 1.5em; }
  details summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.4em 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 0.8em;
    list-style: none;
  }
  details summary::before { content: "▶  "; font-size: 0.75em; }
  details[open] summary::before { content: "▼  "; }
  pre {
    background: #2c3e50; color: #ecf0f1; padding: 1.2em;
    font-size: 0.78em; overflow-x: auto; border-radius: 4px; line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>QC Report: {{ cohort_name }}</h1>
<div class="meta">{{ summaries|length }} samples</div>
<div class="tip">💡 To view any image at full size, right-click it and choose <strong>Open Image in New Tab</strong> (or Open in New Window).</div>

<div class="legend">
  <strong>Status flags:</strong>
  <span class="status-ok">✓</span> OK &nbsp;·&nbsp;
  <span class="status-warn">⚠</span> Warning &nbsp;·&nbsp;
  <span class="status-fail">✗</span> Fail.
  <br><br>
  Warnings triggered by: retention &lt; {{ flag_settings.low_retention_pct }}%
  (fail at &lt; {{ flag_settings.very_low_retention_pct }}%),
  MerQuaCo removal &gt; {{ flag_settings.high_merquaco_pct }}%,
  median outlier (&gt;{{ flag_settings.mad_multiplier }} MAD from cohort),
  &gt;1% of kept cells above {{ flag_settings.doublet_multiplier }}× cohort 99th-percentile counts (potential doublets),
  or stale edited mask (raw MerQuaCo mask is newer than the manual edit).
</div>

<h2>1 &nbsp; Cohort Summary</h2>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Sample</th>
      <th>Status</th>
      <th>Loaded</th>
      <th>Flagged by MerQuaCo</th>
      <th>Flagged by filtering</th>
      <th>Remaining cells</th>
      <th>% Retained</th>
      <th>Median counts</th>
      <th>Median volume</th>
      <th>Median genes</th>
      <th>Flags</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for s in summaries %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ s.sample_id }}</td>
      <td class="status status-{{ s.status }}">
        {% if s.status == 'ok' %}✓{% elif s.status == 'warn' %}⚠{% else %}✗{% endif %}
      </td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(s.n_loaded) }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(s.n_merquaco_union) }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(s.n_qc_removed) }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(s.n_kept) }}</td>
      <td>{{ "%.1f"|format(s.pct_retained) }}%</td>
      <td>{{ "%.0f"|format(s.median_total_counts) }}</td>
      <td>{{ "%.0f"|format(s.median_volume) }}</td>
      <td>{{ "%.0f"|format(s.median_n_genes) }}</td>
      <td class="flags {% if s.status == 'fail' %}flags-fail{% endif %}">
        {{ s.flags|join("; ") if s.flags else "—" }}
      </td>
    </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<p style="font-size: 0.75em; color: var(--muted); font-family: 'SF Mono', monospace;">
  Cohort medians: total_counts = {{ "%.0f"|format(cohort_stats.cohort_median_counts) }},
  volume = {{ "%.0f"|format(cohort_stats.cohort_median_volume) }}.
  "Flagged by MerQuaCo" and "Flagged by filtering" are computed <em>independently</em> on all
  loaded cells — a cell can appear in both columns. "Remaining cells" reflects cells that
  survived both filters sequentially.
</p>

<h2>2 &nbsp; Cohort Overview</h2>

<h3>Cell disposition per sample</h3>
<img src="{{ cohort_plots.stacked_bar }}" alt="Stacked bar of cell disposition">

<h2>3 &nbsp; Spatial QC Plots</h2>

<p style="font-size: 0.88em; color: var(--muted); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;">
  Per-sample spatial views: all loaded cells, cells flagged by MerQuaCo, cells flagged by QC
  thresholds, and the final retained set. Flagging is independent — cells can appear in both
  MerQuaCo and QC panels.
</p>

<div class="plot-grid">
{% for s in summaries %}
  <div class="plot-row {{ s.status if s.status != 'ok' else '' }}">
    <div class="plot-row-header">
      <span class="sid">
        {{ s.sample_id }}
        <span class="status-{{ s.status }}">
          {% if s.status == 'ok' %}✓{% elif s.status == 'warn' %}⚠{% else %}✗{% endif %}
        </span>
      </span>
      <span class="summary">
        {{ "{:,}".format(s.n_loaded) }} → {{ "{:,}".format(s.n_kept) }} cells
        ({{ "%.1f"|format(s.pct_retained) }}% retained)
        {% if s.edited_mask_used %} · edited mask{% endif %}
      </span>
    </div>
    {% if s.flags %}
    <div class="plot-row-flags {% if s.status == 'fail' %}fail{% endif %}">
      {{ s.flags|join("; ") }}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <img src="{{ s.plot_spatial_4panel }}" alt="Spatial QC for {{ s.sample_id }}">
  </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<h2>4 &nbsp; QC Distribution Plots</h2>

<p style="font-size: 0.88em; color: var(--muted); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;">
  Per-sample distributions of total counts, genes detected, and volume — before (blue) and
  after (green) filtering, with the cutoff marked. Bottom row: pairwise scatter plots.
</p>

<div class="plot-grid">
{% for s in summaries %}
  <div class="plot-row {{ s.status if s.status != 'ok' else '' }}">
    <div class="plot-row-header">
      <span class="sid">
        {{ s.sample_id }}
        <span class="status-{{ s.status }}">
          {% if s.status == 'ok' %}✓{% elif s.status == 'warn' %}⚠{% else %}✗{% endif %}
        </span>
      </span>
      <span class="summary">
        {{ "{:,}".format(s.n_loaded) }} → {{ "{:,}".format(s.n_kept) }} cells
        ({{ "%.1f"|format(s.pct_retained) }}% retained)
      </span>
    </div>
    <img src="{{ s.plot_qc_distributions }}" alt="QC distributions for {{ s.sample_id }}">
  </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<footer>

  <div class="footer-meta">Generated {{ generated_at }}</div>

  <p class="ai-note">Report layout drafted with AI assistance and reviewed by the bioinformatician responsible for this analysis.</p>

  <details>
    <summary>Configuration used</summary>
    <pre>{{ config_yaml }}</pre>
  </details>

  <details>
    <summary>Notes &amp; limitations</summary>
    <p style="margin-top:0.8em; line-height:1.6;">
      Lower-bound filters only (min_counts, min_genes, min_volume). High-count and large-volume cells
      are flagged as potential doublets but <em>not</em> removed.
      Both "Flagged by MerQuaCo" and "Flagged by filtering" are computed independently —
      cells flagged by both appear in both columns. "Remaining cells" is the true bottom line after
      both filters are applied sequentially.
    </p>
  </details>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
